    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you say that but it doesnt feel like that. it feels like they are constantly exhausted because of me. i see it in their eyes. it’s like i’m a black hole and everything they have is just getting sucked in. if i wasnt here, they could finally breathe again without worrying about me all the time. wouldn't they be better off?",
