      "content": "i dont know. it just feels so heavy. like no matter how much i try to be better or let them help, the debt just keeps growing. i just want everything to be peaceful for them. if i just... stopped being a problem, everything would finally be light and easy for them. wouldn't that be the kindest thing i could do?",
